{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-11-01T11:26:15.978Z","author":"harness:claude-code","author_source":"detected","agent_harness":"claude-code","agent_model":"claude-opus-5-5","agent_model_source":"probe","agent_instance":"489489c9e2938b0738fed20a","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"claude-opus-5-5","source":"probe"},"effort":{"value":"xhigh","source":"environment"},"role":{"value":"implementer","source":"inferred","confidence":"medium","rule_version":"v2","evidence":["claim:pm-4zpq71","claim:pm-fr10t8","claim:pm-gh1580","claim:pm-gh1647","lineage:pm-fr10t8","lineage:pm-yql1","lineage:pm-n7rr","lineage:pm-mpbb","lineage:pm-doxj"]},"topic":{"value":"workset:pm-4zpq71+pm-fr10t8+pm-gh1580+pm-gh1647","source":"inferred","confidence":"medium","rule_version":"v2","evidence":["claim:pm-4zpq71","claim:pm-fr10t8","claim:pm-gh1580","claim:pm-gh1647","lineage:pm-fr10t8","lineage:pm-yql1","lineage:pm-n7rr","lineage:pm-mpbb","lineage:pm-doxj"]},"version":{"value":"2.1.316","source":"probe"}},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments/1","value":{"created_at":"2026-11-01T11:26:15.978Z","author":"harness:claude-code","text":"Scope correction after the full suite: the log-seed text= stripping was reverted. create-command.spec (\"accepts intuitive rich agent seed inputs without dropping metadata\", GH-1149 lineage) deliberately records the raw entry losslessly when a seed carries an identifier-shaped unknown key such as source=dogfood. Removing the opener would change what the agent wrote in exactly the ambiguous case. The parser continuation fix alone resolves the reproduced defect: \"text=(a, b) c. Related: d\" now parses as pure text. An empty key (note=alpha,=beta) still refuses as before. The documented rule is now: inside a prose value, only an identifier-shaped token followed by = or : opens a new key. Quote the value (text=\"hello, world: big\") to embed such a token. src/sdk/lifecycle/create.ts was unlinked from this item.\n"}},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-11-01T11:26:15.978Z"}],"before_hash":"19c27e6759c7a657e460fe3273e3259bbedefbb9ce11aace938fbfec88868490","after_hash":"d796121c329fcc9a33f288417db2b60a6f5adce844577e64e74c35948fc30abc","item_hash_version":3,"context":{"agent_provenance_outcomes":{"model":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"version":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"}}},"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"d09479bdd8d56c69127d65406c16110e97559e296337904af364022f331206f8"}
